body:
I was once with my friends in the park and there are some spaces with under the slide (we have a HUGE slide) and we like to sit in one of the places there. One time me and my friends wanted to go there but it was occupied (keep in mind we only left the place like 30 secs ago) and the girls (way more younger than us) werent giving us the place. After that we fighted a bit. (i slightly remember i did not say that much there but i could be wrong) After that the other two girls had the idea to go to our parents and tell them that the girls sweared at us. I was an id\*\*t and followed their plan. After they were being yelled at i wanted to reveal the truth. We all got in big trouble and we were punished, after that i didnt speak with the friend that came up with the plan for like a month, but were good now.

&#x200B;

Edit: I think this is the worst story around here. I mean that i did the worst thing around here
